convention of Hintz arXiv:2609.33661v1 and of III). Derivatives are the complex-valued **real** slice derivatives
`cpdC` (`Atlas.EinsteinMaxwell.NP.Basic`); the frame acts by `cdir` (complex-linear combination of real partials).

