(`∂_r`, `∂_θ` of the mode field are `P` times III's `cpd 0`, `cpd 1` of `u` at `toRT x = (r, θ)`), together with
`∂_t ↦ −iω`, `∂_φ ↦ im`. With `K = −(r²+a²)ω + am`, `Q̂ = −aω sinθ + m/sinθ`:

    l(P u)  = P (∂_r u + iK/Δ u)                       = P · Dop    p 0 ω m u     (every x)
